---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---

<PageLayout
  title="Contact — Running Stats"
  description="Get in touch about the Running Stats coach AI. A contact path will live here."
  heading="Contact"
  eyebrow="Placeholder"
>
  <p>
    This page will hold a real way to reach us about the coach AI and your plan.
    There is no form or inbox wired yet—nothing to submit, and no invented
    support claims.
  </p>
  <p>
    Meanwhile, you can read how the coach decides what to run today, or start
    the plan placeholder when you are ready.
  </p>
  <p class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
    <a
      href="/how-it-works"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-lime pb-1 text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.13em] text-cloud uppercase transition-colors hover:text-lime"
    >
      See how it works
    </a>
    <a
      href="/start"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.13em] text-mist uppercase transition-colors hover:text-lime"
    >
      Start your plan
    </a>
  </p>
</PageLayout>
